'''Neo-Necropolis''' (デスメガシティ ''Desumegashiti'', '''Death Megacity''') is the 7th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 56th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
[[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Aliens]] get a noticeable increase in strength from this sub-chapter onward; to properly fight them, it is recommended to have all [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from both the first and second [[Cats of the Cosmos]] chapters.

Overall, Neo-Necropolis is fairly easy for an Uncanny Legends sub-chapter, though [[Midnight Lycopene]] can be a challenge with insufficient Treasures. [[Rogue's Twilight]] and [[Unmanned Station]] can be extremely annoying without stacking [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance Cats]], especially on higher Crown difficulties.

{{LegendDiff|150|200|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:

*[[M. Ost]]: A [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[R.Ost]]. He has more range, damage, and health, but twice the knockbacks and lacking [[Critical Hit]]s. He also has a 100% chance to [[Knockback|knockback]] and [[Slow|slow]] your cats, which could backfire by saving your damage dealers from annihilation.

